  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened capacity of member States to ratify and apply international labour standards and to fulfil their reporting obligations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caribbean countries need to be ready for a new cycle and system of reporting on ratified ILO Conventions. This system will commence in 2027.  
The ILO will provide technical and advisory service to find ways to better manage reporting. Beneficiaries of this initiative will include the government.</narrative>
  </description>
